# Line endings (added 2026-09-25(c)).
# Control manifests hash files byte-for-byte in their CRLF form. Checking every text file out
# with CRLF on every platform (Windows and the Linux CI runner alike) makes those hashes
# reproducible anywhere. Git still stores LF internally.
* text=auto eol=crlf

# Binary formats: never convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip binary
*.pyc binary
*.node binary
*.dll binary
